Some files are derived from external databases that carry their own terms.
Users are responsible for observing those terms in addition to this license:

- **EDH (Epigraphic Database Heidelberg)** — `pipeline/evaluation/name_components/edh_linked_data/`
  and derived evaluation results. EDH publishes its Linked Data under CC BY-SA 4.0.
  See https://edh.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/
- **EDCS (Epigraphik-Datenbank Clauss/Slaby)** — inscription texts and EDCS identifiers,
  retrieved via Lat-Epig. See https://db.edcs.eu/
- **Trismegistos** — HD/EDCS identifier correspondences. See https://www.trismegistos.org/
- **Pleiades** — place identifiers, published under CC BY 3.0.
  See https://pleiades.stoa.org/
